			<div class="content" id="post-content-2696505">
									

<p>The replacement of the bodily fluids with oil is, basically, the skip trying to continue its effects when people aren't allowed in - by making the people trying to contain it items in the lure.</p>
<p>The effect, is not, in fact, a compulsion: it's led by curiosity. You perceive all smells as this one smell, which you can only describe with a particular phrase. If that phrase leads you to a town called Freshwater, Vermont&#8230;</p>
<p>The municipalities not being able to enact capital laws was deliberate on my part, and was meant to be an indication that this town is not&#8230;entirely governed by the rules of the rest of Vermont - perhaps not even truly perceiving it for what it is.</p>
<p>The rest of your complaints, however, are totally valid, and I will be working on them as such.</p>

